                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I really like Squash IRL. It is a fun sport and I have played it a lot in my \"previous\" life. And as much as I would like to enjoy this game as well, I just can't. This is really a completely unfinnished product in every single way. Ball physics is really bad  and basically not working, movement scheme is impossible to use, grahpics is sub par etc etc. I would say this title, in its current state is alpha or even pre-alpha. And to ask 19€ for it is a scam. It is an obvious refund. Stay away until the developers has made this in to a real working products, or at least until they have a beta build to show.",
